[standards/technology/mkdocs/STD-TEC-DOC-004-theme-styling.md#71-logo-implementation]

### 7.1 Logo Implementation

**Logo Configuration**:

```yaml
theme:
    logo: assets/logo.svg
    favicon: assets/favicon.ico
```

**Logo Styling**:

```css
/* Header logo */
.md-header__button.md-logo {
    padding: 0;
}

.md-header__button.md-logo img,
.md-header__button.md-logo svg {
    height: 2rem;
    width: auto;
    filter: brightness(0) invert(1); /* White logo on dark header */
}

/* Footer logo */
.gw-footer-logo {
    height: 3rem;
    width: auto;
    margin-bottom: var(--gw-space-md);
}
```

