[standards/technology/mkdocs/STD-TEC-DOC-004-theme-styling.md#81-breakpoint-system]

### 8.1 Breakpoint System

**Responsive Breakpoints**:

```css
/* Mobile-first breakpoints */
:root {
    --gw-breakpoint-sm: 576px;
    --gw-breakpoint-md: 768px;
    --gw-breakpoint-lg: 992px;
    --gw-breakpoint-xl: 1200px;
}

/* Responsive utilities */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
    .gw-feature-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: var(--gw-space-md);
    }

    .md-typeset h1 {
        font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .md-content__inner {
        padding: 0 var(--gw-space-sm);
    }
}

@media (max-width: 576px) {
    .gw-cta {
        padding: var(--gw-space-md);
        margin: var(--gw-space-lg) 0;
    }

    .md-typeset table {
        font-size: 0.875rem;
    }
}
```

