[standards/technology/mkdocs/STD-TEC-DOC-004-theme-styling.md#91-color-contrast]

### 9.1 Color Contrast

**WCAG AA Compliance**:

```css
/* Ensure minimum 4.5:1 contrast ratio */
:root {
    --gw-high-contrast-text: #212121;
    --gw-high-contrast-bg: #ffffff;
    --gw-link-color: #1565c0; /* 4.5:1 on white */
    --gw-link-visited: #6a1b9a; /* 4.5:1 on white */
}

/* Focus indicators */
.md-nav__link:focus,
.md-search__input:focus,
button:focus,
a:focus {
    outline: 2px solid var(--gw-primary);
    outline-offset: 2px;
}

/* High contrast mode support */
@media (prefers-contrast: high) {
    :root {
        --md-primary-fg-color: #000000;
        --md-accent-fg-color: #000000;
        --md-typeset-color: #000000;
    }
}
```

page_texts.30:
[standards/technology/mkdocs/STD-TEC-DOC-004-theme-styling.md#92-screen-reader-support]

### 9.2 Screen Reader Support

**Assistive Technology Enhancements**:

```css
/* Screen reader only content */
.sr-only {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
}

/* Focus management */
.skip-link {
    position: absolute;
    top: -40px;
    left: 6px;
    background: var(--gw-primary);
    color: white;
    padding: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 0 0 4px 4px;
    z-index: 1000;
}

.skip-link:focus {
    top: 0;
}
```

