[standards/technology/mkdocs/STD-TEC-DOC-004-theme-styling.md#101-css-optimization]

### 10.1 CSS Optimization

**Performance Best Practices**:

```css
/* Minimize repaints and reflows */
.md-content {
    contain: layout style;
}

/* Optimize animations */
.gw-fade-in {
    animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease-in-out;
    will-change: opacity;
}

@keyframes fadeIn {
    from {
        opacity: 0;
    }
    to {
        opacity: 1;
    }
}

/* Efficient selectors */
.md-nav__item--active .md-nav__link {
    /* Specific, efficient selector */
}

/* Avoid expensive properties */
.gw-card {
    transform: translateZ(0); /* Create layer for better performance */
}
```

