### 10.2 Critical CSS

**Above-the-fold Optimization**:

```css
/* Critical CSS for initial paint */
.md-header,
.md-nav,
.md-main,
.md-content {
    /* Essential styles only */
}

/* Non-critical styles loaded separately */
@media print {
    /* Print-specific styles */
    .md-header,
    .md-sidebar,
    .md-nav {
        display: none;
    }
}
```

